SQL Injection and Improper Input Validation The application processes user input for database queries without explicit mention of input sanitization, which can lead to SQL injection vulnerabilities., Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Rendering user-generated content in HTML format without proper escaping can lead to XSS vulnerabilities.

